
### 1. Root endpoint — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### 2. Get Foo — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/foo

### 3. Get Bar — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/bar

### 4. Get unknown item — expect 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/unknown

### 5. Create a new item — expect 200
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test item",
  "description": "A test item"
}
